      "literal_call": "\\otp",
      "arguments": 0,
      "native_aid_active_line": "Note that $\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\triangle$ and $\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\otp$ have no information about the subscripts of $d_{\\ast\\ast}$; in other words, even if we know the triplet of edge lengths, we do not know their vertices."
