      "arguments": 0,
      "native_aid_active_line": "Let $\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\sotp$ (or $\\mathcal{S}_\\sotp$) be the multiset of the multisets of lengths of edges forming simple open $3$-paths (or respectively, with the information of the length of the middle edge):"
