      "arguments": 0,
      "native_aid_active_line": "Next remark that the data of $\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\triangle$ and $\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\sotp$ produce $\\mathcal{S}_\\sotp$, namely, the information of the middle edges of simple open $3$-paths can be obtained from $\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\triangle$ and $\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\sotp$. "
