      "column_1based": 106,
      "literal_call": "\\a",
      "arguments": 0,
      "native_aid_active_line": "We may label the three vertices $P_1, P_2$ and $P_3$ so that the edge we selected is $P_1P_2$. Let $\\ell_\\a=d(P_2,P_3), \\ell_\\beta=d(P_3,P_1)$ and $\\ell_\\ga=d(P_1,P_2)$. "
