      "name": "la",
      "native_aid_line": 606,
      "column_1based": 16,
      "literal_call": "\\la",
      "arguments": 0,
      "native_aid_active_line": "Suppose $[\\ell_\\la,\\ell_\\mu,\\ell_\\ga]\\in\\widetilde{\\mathcal{S}}_\\triangle$. Let the remaining vertex be $P_4$, say. "
